            "scene_context": "Jasper, following the errant ball of yarn, has squeezed through a narrow gap in the diner's foundation wall, emerging into a dark, damp tunnel. The tunnel is lined with crumbling brick and faintly shimmering fungi. Water drips rhythmically. Agnes, peering cautiously from behind Jasper, holds a flickering lantern, its light revealing intricate carvings on the tunnel walls – stylized depictions of cats interwoven with symbols resembling musical notes and blooming flowers. The air hangs heavy with a scent of damp earth and something else… something subtly *lost*. A single, dusty gramophone sits on a small platform mid-tunnel, its horn facing away. The yarn trail leads directly towards it.",
